{"review_id": "4cc836ff-4685-4279-b8d6-4c35ffa8dab8", "package": "com.limatech.dayschallenge.dayschallenge", "app_name": "21 Days Challenge", "language": "fi", "language_name": "Finnish", "rating": 5, "text": "Really nice app! It's super simple to use and the content is simple as well. That's not to say it wouldn't be helpful. These daily micro-challenges are easy (except for the home exercise - not everyone can do 30 push-ups and burpees in a row), effective and sometimes written in a fun way, giving the app some personality! Unfortunately the occasional (still rare) pop-up ads can be a but off-putting. I get that you need to make a living, but isn't there a better way than pop-ups?", "author": "Noland Body", "date": "2020-06-03T17:08:59Z", "thumbs_up": 11, "app_version": "3.3.0", "developer_reply": null}
